459	// validateDistillCanonicalInputs establishes complete-or-refused input safety
460	// before any provider work can be dispatched or any incremental fact/cache
461	// state can be flushed. The pipeline re-reads selected transcripts for bounded
462	// work scheduling; this preflight deliberately favors the egress/publication
